  "description": {
    "en": "Wilson NXT Power 16 is a premium power-oriented multifilament formerly known as NXT Tour. It uses high-crystallinity Xycro microfibers bonded with polyurethane to deliver a soft, comfortable and explosive response, while a ribbon-like co-polymer core improves tensile strength and helps reduce tension loss. Wilson reports a 15% larger sweet spot and 80% less vibration than traditional synthetic gut. At 1.30 mm / 16 gauge, this version offers a stronger balance of power, control and durability than the thinner NXT Power gauges.",

    "zh": "Wilson NXT Power 16 是一款以力量和舒适为核心的高端多芯球线，原名 NXT Tour。它采用高结晶度 Xycro 微纤维并通过 Polyurethane 聚氨酯结合，提供柔软、舒适而且具有爆发力的击球反馈；Ribbon-Like Co-Polymer Core 则用于提升抗拉强度并减少张力流失。Wilson 表示它相比传统 Synthetic Gut 拥有约 15% 更大的 Sweet Spot，并减少约 80% 的震动。1.30 毫米 / 16 Gauge 相比更细的 NXT Power 规格，更强调力量、控制和耐久之间的平衡。"
  },

